{"id":"vod_zy360_57092","vodId":"57092","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"太空丹迪Space☆Dandy","name_cn":"太空丹迪Space☆Dandy","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全26集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20240413-1/cd607edd303d44dad63eb77bb17399ef.jpg"},"summary":"故事背景设定在不远的近未来，地球人的活动空间已触及到茫茫的外太空。故事主人公是一名叫丹迪（诹访部顺一 配音）的宇宙猎人，同时也是有名的花花公子。他和他的搭档——旧型清洁机器人QT（佐武宇绮 配音）一起在宇宙中寻找各种未知的新型外星物种，如果外星人被认定为新品种，那么谁最早发现谁就能获得奖金。在一次追捕中，丹迪和QT遇到一个外形像猫的外星人，丹迪取其名为“喵”（吉野裕行 配音）。从此，丹迪、QT和喵一同在宇宙中到处冒险，并与各种各样的外星人相遇，卷入一场场有趣刺激的故事中。\r\n本动画采用了“单元剧”的模式，使得这部动画像是一个舞台，各路人马各显神通。在展示的动画设计图中，有各式各样的外星人，监督表示动画播出时会每周推出一个外星人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动作,科幻,动画,冒险,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-13 15:47:20","episodeCount":26,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/r4tQmR6h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/hC2DIO4p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/Qsr1wdBj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/AF73bFMA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/pYrac6ll/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/SmurVsvi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/hLqODJcJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/YDzwMnlX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/2Hi8XzTd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/AuZTLcNr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/G1UgXdhk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/MwNPnquI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/6Gf6fLas/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20240413/nBjEMpMn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"